3 Proposed Algorithm
3.1 Deﬁnition of Type-In Gesture
This section proposes a new deﬁnition of the hand gesture that is easy to represent the type-in action. The deﬁnition is explained with Fig. 2 which shows an example of typing in character ‘O’. In the ﬁrst step, the index ﬁnger is placed on ‘O’ key of the virtual keyboard (Fig. 2(a)). The thumb is separated from the index ﬁnger at this initial step as shown in Fig. 2(a). The corresponding character is typed in when the thumb touches the

